I had a few too many tasks getting added to my Someday list and I
thought this was a good opportunity to create the Janitors Task list.
This is what I came up with:

https://wiki.yoctoproject.org/wiki/Janitors

Please have a look and provide your thoughts on the general concept, the
task format, etc.

I've CC'd Scott as the Documentation tasks are really his, I was just
involved with writing the bbvars. We definitely need people to do the
research on those variables, but if they send patches, or just text
descriptions is really up to Scott - so that task may need editing.

Finally, if you like the idea and have some of your own Someday tasks,
please feel free to add them.

